<title>USA: Graham-Field to acquire Everest &amp; Jennings.</title>
<headline>Graham-Field to acquire Everest &amp; Jennings.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Graham-Field Health Products Inc said Tuesday that it agreed to acquire Everest &amp; Jennings International Ltd.</p>
<p>According to the terms of the definitive agreement, stockholders of Everest &amp; Jennings will receive one share of its stock for each 2.857 shares of Everest &amp; Jennings' common stock.</p>
<p>Everest &amp; Jennings has about 7.2 million shares outstanding, Graham-Field said in a release.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in November.</p>
</text>
